 glass box kind of glow a little bit  but that's it really really nicely done  one of the more beautiful wi-fi systems  i've seen on the market probably in the  top three in terms of looks in my  personal opinion is this xt12 it looks  the business but it's stacked man it is  completely stacked with all the ports  that you want on this uh so as i  mentioned before you want to plug this  in a variety of different products you  can do that it is a mesh system where  you can connect to other asus routers as  well as long as they're as they're  compatible but because this is a 5g one  and five g2 it is an 802.11 ax system ac  system  uh and all the legacy bands are in there  as well so you are covered for a variety  of different products and also the  distance because they're claiming six  thousand square feet coverage for two  nodes that's pretty impressive because  in my home here i i use the tp-link deco  x60 great router system especially for  the price when the best bang for your  dollars you're going to get out there  but i need about three nodes to cover me  from the various different rooms and to  have that coverage that i want but i do  lose a little bit of speed because of  those notes  with this two nodes covers my entire  home with no issues at all i probably  could get away with one  but it would be a little bit challenging  in some of the farther rooms in my  apartment but outside of that  i think two's the safe spot and it does  it's just tremendous it's fantastic this  video is brought to you by secret lab  here at geek culture we love our secret  lab chairs especially the all new 2022  titan evo with its revamped 4-way lumbar  system for enhanced back support if you  leather 2.0 isn't your cup of tea then  consider the all-new soft weave even  more soft and breathable than before the  chair comes in more colors including  this lovely frost blue the titan evo is  even magnetized allowing the head pillow  to stick on the headrest without straps  of course