n and you want good performance so  if you have let's say nas uh storage  drive system in your home uh synology  whatever it may be if you want to if  you're a hardcore gamer you want to do  some hardcore media uploading and files  and you want a direct connection to your  router you can do that as well with this  and you have the options for faster  speeds this is an option to look into  but if you are just on a budget and  you're like look i just browse the web  once in a while i watch a little bit on  netflix i don't care about  you know all these things i don't need  the best the top speeds i just need good  connection then you could probably save  some money and go for another option  asus has a lot of other options but it's  with other brands as well so this is not  going to be for everybody but it's going  to be for the ones that want the best of  the best and you want that top of the  line from asus or from any router  manufacturer i think this is probably  going to be one of the top three on the  list thus far for 2022. anyway those are  my thoughts on this xt-12 system let me  know your thoughts in the comment  section below are you looking to pick up  are you gonna say now pass away for  something else love to hear from you  guys with that follow us on facebook  subscribe to us on youtube like this  video helps us out a lot take care stay  safe  and i'll chat to you soon  [Music]  [Applause]

